时对方的语气或表情，是不是让你觉得先认下来才安全？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"那种“话到嘴边自动转弯”的反应，往往比说错话更让人难受——你恶心的可能不是那句话，而是自己又一次没拦住它。当时对方的语气或表情，是不是让你觉得先认下来才安全？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2889,"promptTokens":201,"completionTokens":151,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:57:11"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":29,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007575798640849973,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af68a97f4429d1fd72f8adf","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794542231354,"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:57:11","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af68a97f4429d1fd72f8adf","chatId":"36d352a56bdd476f9f0a37ad35b7899e","sessionId":null,"userId":99936,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"我当时想说“不是我弄的，你先听我讲完”。可话到嘴边就变成“好的，我改”。说完自己都恶心，觉得怎么又这样。<第14轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":28,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007575798640849973,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":5,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":5,"sort":9},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":3,"sort":7},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":2,"sort":6},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":1,"sort":4},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":1,"sort":5},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":0,"sort":3}],"relationId":"6af68a97f4429d1fd72f8ae0","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794542231351,"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:57:11","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af68a91f4429d1fd72f8acf","chatId":"36d352a56bdd476f9f0a37ad35b7899e","sessionId":null,"userId":99936,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"这不是怂，更像身体先把你推到“先平息对方”的位置，委屈却留到回家才冒出来。最近一次，你当时最想回的那句话是什么？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"这不是怂，更像身体先把你推到“先平息对方”的位置，委屈却留到回家才冒出来。最近一次，你当时最想回的那句话是什么？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1668,"promptTokens":197,"completionTokens":177,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:57:05"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":27,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.010985221923637921,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af68a91f4429d1fd72f8ace","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794542225401,"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:57:05","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af68a91f4429d1fd72f8ace","chatId":"36d352a56bdd476f9f0a37ad35b7899e","sessionId":null,"userId":99936,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"领导吧。尤其对方声音一大，我明明没做错什么，也会先想道歉。可回家我又会气自己，怎么这么怂。<第13轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":26,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.010985221923637921,"emotions":[{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":6,"sort":6},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":5,"sort":7},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":4,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":4,"sort":9},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":1,"sort":4},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":0,"sort":3},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6af68a91f4429d1fd72f8acf","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794542225399,"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:57:05","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af68a8af4429d1fd72f8ac0","chatId":"36d352a56bdd476f9f0a37ad35b7899e","sessionId":null,"userId":99936,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"听起来你的身体一直处在戒备里，像还没从某种威胁中退出来。这种紧绷在跟谁说话时最明显？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"听起来你的身体一直处在戒备里，像还没从某种威胁中退出来。这种紧绷在跟谁说话时最明显？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":12582,"promptTokens":204,"completionTokens":101,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:56:58"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":25,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0330752470041925,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af68a8af4429d1fd72f8abf","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794542218599,"createTime":"2026-11-13 11:56:58","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6